v 3
d barttest: Bar chart of group means with CI error bars and pairwise t-test brackets
d
d Significant comparisons are drawn with a solid bracket, non-significant with a
d dashed bracket; each bracket is labeled with the mean difference and p-value
d (or significance stars).
d
d Requires: Stata 16 or newer.
d
d Author: Wen-Cheng Lin, CAHSS, National Taiwan University
d Source: https://github.com/ganma0517/stata_barttest
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260530
d
f barttest.ado
f barttest.sthlp
